Note: this project displays data from public sources under their own terms —
basemap resources from OpenFreeMap / OpenMapTiles using OpenStreetMap data; hazard data from the US
National Weather Service, Environment and Climate Change Canada, USGS, NIFC,
Natural Resources Canada CWFIS, NASA EONET, and RainViewer; organization data
includes IMLS and NCES public-use sources plus a curated demonstration set.
MapLibre GL JS is distributed under its own BSD 3-Clause license. See
DATA_SOURCES.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. These third-party materials and data
sources are not covered by the MIT license above.
